  "description": "The relationship between On Tae-hyuk and Chae Ji-a was all lies.\n\n\"I quit.\"\n\nThe jet-black hair and eyes, the relationship that was supposed to be nothing more than an executive and a secretary. So Jia tried to end all the lies by leaving Tae-hyuk.\n\n\"Secretary Chae.... I didn't hear anything, I didn't see anything.\"  \n\"I have nothing more to say.\"\n\nThe distance between them grew a little closer. Tae-hyuk's hand touched her dark hair.\n\n\"I don't think I want to keep quiet anymore either.\"  \n\"Ms. On, wait, wait, wait. Ouch!\"\n\nWhite hair, resembling snow falling in the middle of winter, mingled with jet-black hair, resembling the deepest night, and spilled out. Over her dark colored jacket. Like a soundless snowfall.\n\n\"Hide and seek is over.  \nIt's good to see you again. Bye.\"\n\nBut just as she was about to end it all,  \nhis relentless, dark obsession reared its ugly head.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=5814434), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8377682)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10101899)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10101827)",
